{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24788","headline":"七老会诗 · 刘真","name":"七老会诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"垂丝今日幸同筵，朱紫居身是大年。\n赏景尚知心未退，吟诗犹觉力完全。\n闲庭饮酒当三月，在席挥毫象七贤。\n山茗煮时秋雾碧，玉杯斟处彩霞鲜。\n临堦花笑如歌妓，傍竹松声当管弦。\n虽未学穷生死诀，人间岂不是神仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘真","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24788.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24788","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}